  "title": "中興通訊 (ZTE) 搭載最新版 Firefox OS 智慧型手機於 eBay 上開賣",
  "date": "2014-05-09",
  "year": 2014,
  "month": 5,
  "day": 9,
  "categories": [
    "Firefox OS"
  ],
